onboarding-movement-detail = Movement advances the authoritative turn. Bumping a hostile creature performs a melee attack.
onboarding-movement-control-numpad = Use Numpad 1–9 to move in eight directions; Numpad 5 waits.
onboarding-movement-control-vi = Use HJKL and YUBN to move in eight directions; period waits.
onboarding-movement-control-wasd = Use WASD and QEZC to move in eight directions; Space waits.
onboarding-look-title = Inspect the map
onboarding-look-detail = Look mode moves a cursor without advancing time and reports visible occupants at its position.
onboarding-look-control = Press X or use Look, move the cursor, then press Esc or Enter to leave look mode.
onboarding-pickup-title = Pick up surface supplies
onboarding-pickup-detail = Move onto an item before picking it up. The inventory panel confirms successful collection.
onboarding-pickup-control = Stand on an item and press G.
onboarding-inventory-title = Inspect your inventory
onboarding-inventory-detail = An item must be selected before its available actions are enabled.
onboarding-inventory-control = Select an inventory checkbox and review the enabled Use, Equip, Appraise, and Drop actions.
onboarding-equipment-title = Equip or use a useful item
onboarding-equipment-detail = Collect more surface supplies if the selected item cannot be equipped or used by this build.
onboarding-equipment-control = Select one usable or equippable item, then choose Use or Equip.
onboarding-combat-title = Engage a hostile target
onboarding-combat-detail = Move into an adjacent hostile creature for melee, or use a valid launcher, item, or ability target mode.
onboarding-combat-control = Press F for launcher targeting; targeted abilities and items expose their own Aim action.
onboarding-stairs-title = Traverse a connection
onboarding-stairs-detail = Stairs, shafts, and rifts work only while you are standing on their map cell.
onboarding-stairs-control = Stand on a connection and press < or >.
onboarding-warrens-entrance-title = Enter the Warrens
onboarding-warrens-entrance-detail = The surface cave mouth is marked >, one cell south of your starting position. Moving onto it does not change floors automatically.
onboarding-warrens-entrance-control = Stand on >, then choose Enter Warrens or press Shift + . (>).
onboarding-resources-title = Watch and recover resources
onboarding-resources-detail = Resource pools and costs are shown in the Abilities panel. Resting can recover supported pools but may be interrupted.
onboarding-resources-control = Use Rest in the Abilities panel when recovery is useful.
onboarding-messages-title = Use the message history
onboarding-messages-detail = Command results, rejections, combat, and journey transitions appear chronologically in Messages.
onboarding-messages-control = Perform an action and verify its localized result in the Messages panel.
onboarding-save-title = Create a native checkpoint
onboarding-save-detail = Native saves preserve authoritative state and can be discovered from the title screen before a new session.
onboarding-save-control = Enter a save name in Native Saves and choose Create.

