maia-path-enlightened-description = Remove hunger and gain light, armor growth, time/light resistance, see invisible and curse sensing on pickup. At level 50 gain levitation, poison/electricity/cold resistance, cold/electricity auras and slay evil on weapons. Forbids Death, Daemon, Hex and Necromancy. This choice is permanent.
maia-path-corrupted-description = Remove hunger and gain life growth, time/fire/dark resistance and removal of light equipment curses. At level 50 gain poison resistance, fire immunity and a fire aura. Forbids Life and Crusade. This choice is permanent.
trait-maia-rule-birth = Begin uninitiated with demon and evil sensing, 10 grids of infravision and slow digestion.
trait-maia-rule-choice = Choose enlightenment or corruption at level 20. Both paths remove hunger and persist through level loss.
trait-maia-rule-realms = Enlightenment forbids Death, Daemon, Hex and Necromancy; corruption forbids Life and Crusade. Learned spells and book browsing remain available.
