ability-resource-conversion-cost-help = The listed zero spell cost excludes the internal conversion payment above. A failed activation spends a turn without converting resources. The log shows actual HP and mana before and after conversion.
ability-bless-weapon-help = Select a weapon in your pack, equipment or at your feet. Cancelling costs no time or resources. Curses or weapon properties can block blessing; resistance may reduce enchantments. Success reveals only the blessing and sets a 99% discount.
ability-evocation-summary = Dispel damage { $damage } · fear and teleport power { $power }. Each stage affects surviving monsters within line of sight and effect. Casting still costs resources with no targets.
