trait-life-rule = Starts at 100%, adds equipment life modifiers, and floors at 1%. This is one HP calculation stage, not the total maximum-HP multiplier. Source modifiers are percentage points.
trait-natural-regeneration-rule = Starts at 100%, adds race, mutation and timed modifiers, and floors at 0%. Timed regeneration adds 100 percentage points only once. Actual recovery also depends on nutrition, rest and the mutation recovery factor.
trait-mutation-regeneration-rule = An independent core multiplier based on unlocked mutation count and birth-race rules, floored at 10%. It is neither extra recovery points nor a sum of mutation bonuses.
trait-stat-rule = Sources follow the existing calculation pipeline; the current value comes directly from the core. Bounds and special rules can make it differ from a simple sum.
