trait-selected-attack = Selected attack source
trait-unselected-attack = Not the selected attack source
trait-known-melee-bonus = Known extra-attack modifier: { $value } (shared melee calculation)
trait-known-shot-bonus = Known base-shot modifier: { $value } percentage points
trait-weapon-selection-rule = Equipped weapons attack separately with their own damage, slays and brands. Dual-wield accuracy depends on proficiency and weapon weight; Genji gloves improve it. Draconian metamorphosis replaces weapon attacks with innate attacks.
trait-launcher-selection-rule = Shooting uses the selected launcher and compatible ammunition. This modifier belongs to this launcher, not every weapon.
