trait-curse-effect-teleport = Random teleport
trait-curse-rule-aggravate = The equipped effect is enabled under current rules. A qualifying fairy racial trait converts it to a stealth penalty instead of waking monsters.
trait-curse-rule-teleport = Checked periodically, not an immediate teleport. Certain intrinsic teleport effects are suppressed when uncursed and inscribed with a period; the environment can still prevent teleportation.
trait-curse-severity-rule = The heading is known curse severity only. Effects apply to the character, not just this weapon's attacks. Active means the source is enabled, not that it triggers every turn. Only independently known, implemented effects are listed; severity does not imply others.
trait-no-negatives = No revealed curses or projected negative effects; unknown equipment may still have negative properties.
