trait-curse-effect-ty-curse = Ancient Curse
trait-curse-rule-ty-curse = Every 10 ticks, has a 1 in 200 chance to trigger the curse.
trait-curse-effect-drain-experience = Drain experience
trait-curse-rule-drain-experience = Each periodic check has a 1 in 4 chance to drain current and maximum experience. Androids are exempt.
trait-curse-effect-add-heavy-curse = Add heavy curse
trait-curse-rule-add-heavy-curse = Each periodic check has a 1 in 2000 chance to add a curse to an item carrying this effect.
trait-curse-effect-call-demon = Attract demons
trait-curse-rule-call-demon = Each periodic check has a 1 in 1111 chance to summon hostile demons.
trait-curse-effect-call-dragon = Attract dragons
trait-curse-rule-call-dragon = Each periodic check has a 1 in 800 chance to summon hostile dragons.
trait-curse-effect-by-curse = Baby curse
trait-curse-rule-by-curse = Each periodic check has a 1 in 200 chance to cause fear, stun, attribute loss and other harmful effects.
trait-curse-effect-danger = Attract danger
trait-curse-rule-danger = Raises the selection level of natural monsters and hostile summons.
trait-curse-effect-crappy-mutation = Harmful mutation
trait-curse-rule-crappy-mutation = Each periodic check has a 1 in 1500 chance to gain a harmful mutation.
trait-curse-effect-slow-regeneration = Slow regeneration
trait-curse-rule-slow-regeneration = Reduces health regeneration to one fifth.
trait-curse-effect-add-light-curse = Add light curse
trait-curse-rule-add-light-curse = Each periodic check has a 1 in 2000 chance to add a light curse to an item carrying this effect.
trait-curse-effect-call-animal = Attract animals
trait-curse-rule-call-animal = Each periodic check has a 1 in 2500 chance to summon hostile animals.
trait-curse-effect-cowardice = Cowardice
trait-curse-rule-cowardice = Each periodic check has a 1 in 1500 chance to require a fear save. Failure adds fear.
trait-curse-effect-low-melee = Inaccurate attacks
trait-curse-rule-low-melee = The corresponding weapon or launcher loses 5 accuracy, or 15 with the heavy curse flag.
trait-curse-effect-low-armor = Low armor
trait-curse-rule-low-armor = Loses 10 armor bonus, or 30 with the heavy curse flag.
trait-curse-effect-low-magic = Increased spell failure
trait-curse-rule-low-magic = Each item adds 3 percentage points of spell failure, or 10 with the heavy curse flag.
trait-curse-effect-fast-digest = Fast digestion
trait-curse-rule-fast-digest = Adds 30 nutrition consumption before slow digestion is applied.
trait-curse-effect-drain-hp = Drain health
trait-curse-rule-drain-hp = Each periodic check has a 1 in 666 chance to lose twice your level in health, capped at 100.
trait-curse-effect-drain-mana = Drain mana
trait-curse-rule-drain-mana = With mana remaining, each periodic check has a 1 in 666 chance to lose your level in mana, capped at 50.
trait-curse-effect-catlike = Noisy steps
trait-curse-rule-catlike = Reduces stealth by 4. Multiple copies do not stack.
trait-curse-effect-drain-pack = Drain devices
trait-curse-rule-drain-pack = Each periodic check has a 1 in 333 chance to try draining a device in your pack.
trait-curse-effect-allergy = Irritated airways
trait-curse-rule-allergy = While well, each periodic check has a 1 in 888 chance to become unwell, subject to racial conditions.
trait-curse-effect-open-wounds = Open wounds
trait-curse-rule-open-wounds = Wounds recover at one third of their normal rate while dealing unchanged damage.
trait-curse-effect-normality = Dispel magic
trait-curse-rule-normality = Each periodic check has a 1 in 128 chance to dispel temporary benefits.
trait-curse-effect-low-device = Device failure
trait-curse-rule-low-device = Reduces device skill by 5, or 10 with the heavy curse flag. Only the largest penalty applies.
