casino-rules-text = The wager limit is level × 200 and your available gold. The stake is paid first; all multipliers below describe the total return. In-Between: the red die must fall strictly between the two black dice, paying 4×. Craps: an opening 7/11 wins, 2/3/12 loses; otherwise roll that point again before a 7 to win, paying 2×. Wheel: match a number from 0–9 for 9×. Slots: symbol weights are 6/5/4/3/2/1; triples pay 5/10/20/50/200/1000×, and only the first two matching the first symbol pay 2×. Poker: 53 cards include one joker; draw once. Five aces/five of a kind/royal flush/straight flush/four/full house/flush/straight/three/two pairs pay 3000/400/200/80/16/12/8/4/1/1×; a pair or no hand pays nothing. Ending a session at or above its starting gold adds 3 Chance; a net loss subtracts 3. Finish pending dice or poker rounds before leaving; saved games resume the same round.
