controls-original = Numbers/numpad move; 5 waits. w equips, t takes off, d drops, k destroys, e lists equipment, i opens inventory, I inspects; G studies, b browses, U opens powers, m casts; A activates, E eats, q drinks, r reads, a/u/z use devices, F refuels, v throws, braces inscribe/remove inscriptions; C character, = settings, l look, s search, o open door/chest, D disarm, T dig, B bash, c close, f fire, R rest, g pick up, J resume travel. Ctrl+S saves, Ctrl+X exits after saving, Ctrl+Q tasks, Ctrl+P messages. Backtick travel, Ctrl+G auto-get, ] objects and _ rules remain available; Esc stops. Period then direction runs; Z auto-explores. n repeats the previous command and its selections. H travels to the nearest suitable unidentified item. S toggles searching; s searches once. Moving/waiting searches while enabled, normally at speed −10. Plus then direction, or Ctrl+navigation/numpad, alters the adjacent grid; empty ground also spends an action. Opening doors/chests, bashing, digging, disarming, closing and altering automatically attempt up to 99 times, stopping on completion or disturbance; a 0 count prefix overrides this, Esc stops. R chooses rest: turns, * HP/resources, & complete recovery (default); 0 or Cancel does not rest.
controls-roguelike = Numbers/numpad or hjklyubn move; 5/period waits. Common item keys follow Original; T takes off, t fires, f bashes, x looks, z uses wands, a uses rods, O opens powers, left parenthesis resumes travel, Ctrl+D destroys, Ctrl+T digs. Backslash reads the next key as Original: backslash then b browses, u uses a staff. Ctrl+S saves, Ctrl+X exits after saving, Ctrl+Q tasks, Ctrl+P messages, = settings. Comma then direction or uppercase directions run; Z auto-explores. X repeats the previous command and its selections. Ctrl+E travels to the nearest suitable unidentified item; H still runs west. # toggles searching; s searches once. Moving/waiting searches while enabled, normally at speed −10. Plus then direction, Ctrl+hjklyubn or Ctrl+navigation/numpad alters the adjacent grid; empty ground also spends an action. Opening doors/chests, bashing, digging, disarming, closing and altering automatically attempt up to 99 times, stopping on completion or disturbance; a 0 count prefix overrides this, Esc stops. R chooses rest: turns, * HP/resources, & complete recovery (default); 0 or Cancel does not rest.

