guide-scope-artifacts = Retains identified fixed artifacts and fully identified random artifact names for this character, including after sale or loss. Type descriptions do not reconstruct a lost item's random properties.
guide-scope-objects = Retains recognized item kinds and descriptions after consumption, sale and loading. Unknown appearances never reveal true identities.
guide-scope-egos = Retains recognized ego kinds and descriptions after the original item is lost. Unidentified additional properties remain hidden.
guide-scope-autopick = Open pickup/destruction rules for the current language and their syntax help. Rules change only when edits are applied.
guide-scope-materials = Open the character's Other page to see current materials. Crafting remains available through its existing ability or facility.
guide-scope-monsters = Retains recognized monster identities and research. Fuzzy sensing and hallucination reveal no true identity; disguises record only the apparent kind. Full properties still require research or probing.
guide-scope-wanted = Show the daily target and wanted list supplied by current facilities. Unavailable facility information is not inferred.
guide-scope-uniques = Shows known uniques, filtered by alive or dead. Alive means not permanently defeated, not necessarily present on this floor. Unknown kinds are excluded.
guide-scope-kills = Ranks kills credited to this character, using the core's pet credit rules. Environmental deaths, dismissal and summon expiry do not count. Only recognized or researched kinds are shown.
guide-scope-pets = View currently displayable pets and total party upkeep without issuing orders. For commands, naming and permissions, leave knowledge and use p or the pet-menu button.
guide-pet = { $name } · Level { $level }
guide-scope-dungeons = Retains visited dungeons and deepest reached levels across recall, random entry and regenerated instances. Unvisited dungeons are excluded.
guide-scope-quests = Open current task information, including objectives, status and rewards.
guide-scope-terrain = Open symbol queries and enter one character for its legend. This view does not edit terrain visuals.
guide-scope-self = Open character overview for current attributes, status and resources.
guide-scope-weapon = Open the Attacks detail page. Damage and sources respect current equipment knowledge.
guide-scope-shooter = Open the Attacks detail page for current shooting information. No damage is invented when a valid launcher is absent.
guide-scope-mutations = Open the character's Other page for acquired mutations and effects.
guide-scope-virtues = Open the character's Other page for current virtues.
guide-scope-extra = Open Other for materials, mutations and growth information. Class-specific abilities remain on the ability page.
guide-scope-scores = View the final scores of all completed characters in this local profile.
guide-scope-weapon-skills = Open Proficiencies for current weapon, riding, mining and related progress.
guide-scope-spell-skills = Open the ability page for spell details and proficiency. Browsing does not cast.
