prf-title = Advanced import and backup (!)
prf-help = PRF exchanges supported X/Y, R/K/V and single-key A+C only. Preview, add to draft, then save. Use JSON for a complete backup. R/K require a known identity with an unambiguous source mapping; glyph overrides do not alter image tiles.
prf-command = Single preference command
prf-preview = Preview command
prf-file = Preview PRF file
prf-export = Export saved PRF subset
prf-accept = Add preview to draft
prf-subset-required = I agree to skip the listed unsupported entries and import the supported subset.
prf-preview-stale = The draft changed. Preview the command or file again.
prf-blocked = Errors block this entire input. Current settings remain unchanged.
prf-ready = Final differences follow. Add to the draft and save to apply them.
prf-export-omitted = This PRF subset cannot fully represent these fields; back them up with JSON: { $fields }
prf-reload-playing = Reload pickup rules during a game.
mogaminator-reload = Reload saved rules ($)
mogaminator-reloaded = Reloaded Mogaminator rules and policy from saved global preferences. Unsaved drafts are preserved.
cfg-command-advanced-preferences = Advanced preference import
cfg-command-reload-pickup-rules = Reload pickup rules
prf-reason-syntax = Invalid syntax; use the supported flat PRF format.
prf-reason-range = Number outside the supported range.
prf-reason-palette-range = Only colors 0–15, kv=0 and RGB 0–255 are supported.
prf-reason-visual-range = Only attr 0–15 and char 0 or visible ASCII 33–126 are supported; use the glyph editor or JSON for other supported glyphs.
prf-reason-leading-space = Skipped a leading-whitespace line, as in the original loader.
prf-reason-context-required = Conditions and includes block the entire file; provide an expanded flat file.
prf-reason-unmapped-visual = No known, unambiguous source mapping for this number.
prf-reason-single-key-only = Only one printable key mapped to one existing input action is supported; control/escape encodings, direction prefixes, menu answers and sequences are unsupported.
prf-reason-mapping-context = C requires mode 0/1 and a preceding A in this file.
prf-reason-unused-action = A has no following supported C mapping.
prf-reason-theme-tileset = Handled by themes and tilesets; no equivalent legacy toggle or rendering channel.
prf-reason-contextual-descriptions = Lists and details use contextual descriptions; legacy abbreviation toggles are unsupported.
prf-reason-enemy-stop-policy = Uses the current enemy stop policy, not separate legacy disturbance switches.
prf-reason-character-creation = Belongs to character creation, not global preferences.
prf-reason-mogaminator-rules = Use Mogaminator rules and protection templates.
prf-reason-no-equivalent-option = No equivalent global option; fixed rules, deferred and inapplicable settings cannot be enabled through PRF.
prf-reason-terrain-index = Terrain has no general original numeric index; use stable IDs in the glyph editor or JSON.
prf-reason-misc-index = Legacy miscellaneous numeric indices are unsupported.
prf-reason-appearance-category = Legacy appearance/inventory color categories are not equivalent.
prf-reason-effect-colors = Legacy effect color sequences have no equivalent consumer.
prf-reason-macro-sequence = Arbitrary multikey triggers and macro expansion are unsupported.
prf-reason-terminal-template = Legacy platform trigger templates do not apply.
prf-reason-unknown-directive = This directive is outside the supported PRF subset.
prf-reset-base = Remove shared PRF override for this base kind
prf-reason-mapping-invalid = Key mappings exceed the limit or violate reserved-key/duplicate constraints.

